==Trivia==
*Vornado first became obtainable in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] on June 26th, 2026.
*Vornado's name may be a combination of ''vortex'' and ''tornado''.
*In BCJP, Vornado is the second [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Dragon Emperor]] to be called a "machine" and "ancient weapon", the first being [[Raiden (Uber Rare Cat)|Raiden]]. Both are also [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]], and with God-Emperor Raiden's Ultra [[Talents]], both are immune to [[Surge Attack|Surge]].

